  "releaseNotes": "Version 3.0.1: Patch release — fixes missing source generator in NuGet package. The Roslyn source generator DLL is now correctly embedded under analyzers/dotnet/cs/ so consumers receive auto-registration code generation when installing from NuGet. Also fixes snupkg symbol package validation by embedding the generator PDB into the DLL (DebugType=embedded) to prevent NuGet.org rejection.",
